      ],
      "example": "Week",
      "help_en": "The unit of the subscription duration. Request parameter is used together with Period to specify the complete subscription duration. Valid combinations of Period and PeriodUnit are as follows:\n\n1 Week (1 week)\n1 Month (1 month)\n2 Months (2 months)\n3 Months (3 months)\n6 Months (6 months)\n1 Year (1 year)\n2 Years (2 years)\n3 Years (3 years)\n\nRequest parameter is case-sensitive. For example, Week is valid, but week is invalid. If the combination of Period and PeriodUnit does not match the preceding valid combinations, such as 2 Week, the API call succeeds but an error occurs during the order placement stage",
      "help_zh": "资源购买时长的单位部分，与`Period`一起表示完整的购买时长。可使用的`Period`与`PeriodUnit`的搭配如下：\n\n1 Week（1周）\n1 Month（1个月）\n2 Month（2个月）\n3 Month（3个月）\n6 Month（6个月）\n1 Year（1年）\n2 Year（2年）\n3 Year（3年）\n\n该参数区分大小写。例如，`Week`是有效的，`week`是无效的。另外，如果请求参数不符合上述搭配，例如`2 Week`，虽然调用本接口会成功，但最终在下单阶段会出错",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "period_unit",
      "options": [
        "--period-unit"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PeriodUnit",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "aig-9ciijz60n4xsv****",
      "help_en": "The ID of the delivery group. You can call the https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/428506.html operation to retrieve the ID",
      "help_zh": "交付组ID。可通过接口https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/428506.html获取。\n\n仅包年包月（PrePaid）且底层实例已就绪的交付组可查询续费价格：实例未就绪时返回`CAN_NOT_FIND_INSTANCE`，交付组不可用（如尚未发布成功或已释放）时无法取得续费价格。续费本身要求交付组处于PUBLISHED状态，详见[RenewAppInstanceGroup](~~RenewAppInstanceGroup~~)",
      "location": "query",
